            "review_title": "Review at V Steak Station",
            "review_text": "Tedistravelling\nQueensland, Australia228 contributions\n0\nPromising, but disappointing..\nFeb 2023 • Couples\nWe dined at this restaurant while staying at a nearby hotel. Being that the establishment presented quite well from the outside we thought we'd give it a go. We tried a number of dishes but were quite disappointed. Presentation of our meals were acceptable though the meals were luke warm and lacked seasoning. Considering we were the first in the first in the restaurant our meals took some time to be serviced. Prices were definitely mid-high for the quality of food we were served. Staff were not very attentive and constantly searching their mobile phones. Cannot recommend given our experience.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 8, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
