            "review_title": "Review at V Steak Station",
            "review_text": "Meegan V\n17 contributions\n0\nGreat little steak restaurant\nDec 2022\nStayed at a hotel nearby, was finding it hard to find recent reviews of any restaurants in general. We decided to try our luck and what a great find. Fantastic service, so much to choose from on the menu. Very lovely and friendly staff, very cold drinks. We chose steaks which came out on a hotplate which kept our steak sizzling and added to a very enjoyable meal. Would highly recommend, something for everyone and very clean restaurant area.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 4, 2022",
