            "review_text": "Davethepubsinger\nTenerife, Spain275 contributions\n0\nFriendly staff and reasonable prices\nFeb 2020\nMy wife and I were staying in a hotel near by and were looking for somewhere we could eat at a reasonable price and where the drinks were also competitive. This restaurant fitted the bill. We both went for pasta dishes which were excellent and I had beers for around £1 a can. The two dishes and drinks came to around £10. The staff were friendly, especially one girl who spoke good English and had a sense of humour. There were a couple of tables outside where we sat and people watched after eating.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 7, 2020",
