            "review_title": "Review at V Steak Station",
            "review_text": "Claudia\nEngland, United Kingdom11 contributions\n0\nThere are better steakhouses in the city.\nNov 2019 • Couples\nWe went for a steak here as a treat to ourselves because we are on a backpacking budget. The steak was very fatty but the small portion we received had a lot of flavour. The veg and chips that came along side the steak were minimal to say the least. I would certainly recommend ordering side dishes. \n\nThe hot plate that the steak comes on was far too hot, the staff had problems carrying the plate out and it spat hot oil at us constantly. I even asked for them to take it away and was given a normal plate. We also found the staff quite rude.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 4, 2019",
