            "review_text": "ch0c0latech0ps\nHamlyn Terrace, Australia39 contributions\n0\nAwesome food\nSep 2019\nWe stayed in a hotel very close to V Steak Station it was delicious. We had lunch and then dinner on 2 other occasions. We had come to the end of our 21 day trip and were really hanging for some western food and it did not disappoint. We had Singapore noodles for lunch which were yummy then Cajun chicken for dinner and it was awesome plus dessert of course and great coffee. Great chef and lovely girls serving. Would highly recommend eating here\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 22, 2019",
